  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/banner.png\" alt=\"Soul Fire&#x27;d banner\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=26.1&version=26.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"Loader\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client-server.svg\" alt=\"Overlay\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"Issues\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/soul-fire-d/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2>\n<p>是否曾注意到《我的世界》中的靈魂之火外觀獨特，卻沒有表現出與普通火焰不同的特性？<strong>Soul Fire'd</strong> 修正了這個問題，讓靈魂之火完全按照您的預期運作！</p>\n<p>本模組確保<strong>靈魂之火擁有獨特的行為</strong>，包括特殊的傷害效果、自訂附魔等。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>重要提示</strong>：由於本模組引入了重大的玩法變更，而不僅僅是視覺效果，因此必須在<strong>客戶端和伺服器端</strong>都安裝 <strong>Soul Fire'd</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fsoul-fired%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ <strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p>🔵 <strong>靈魂之火覆蓋層</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/overlay.gif\" alt=\"Overlay\"><br>\n<em>偏好更纖細的版本？請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/slim-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slim Fire</a>！</em></p></li>\n<li><p>🔥 <strong>一致的靈魂之火傷害</strong><br>\n觸及靈魂之火的實體會燃燒出明顯的藍色火焰，每秒受到 2 點傷害。<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/sheep.gif\" alt=\"Sheep\"></p></li>\n<li><p>🎯 <strong>一致的靈魂之火機制</strong><br>\n舉例來說（但不限於此），被靈魂之火燒灼的殭屍，以及穿透靈魂之火的箭矢都能使目標陷入靈魂之火燃燒狀態。<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/soul-fire-d/arrow.gif\" alt=\"Arrows\"></p></li>\n<li><p>📚 <strong>全新附魔：靈魂之火附魔面 &amp; 靈魂烈焰。</strong><br>\n類似火焰附魔面與烈焰之弓附魔，但改為施加靈魂之火，造成額外傷害。<br>\n這兩項附魔均可進行高度自訂配置，可單獨啟用（預設）或停用它們等。<br>\n<em>自 <code>1.21</code> 起，配置透過資料包（datapack）完成</em></p></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🤝 <strong>相容性</strong></h2>\n<p>已完全整合至 Soul Fire'd 的模組：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a> 搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetracelium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetracelium</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decorative Blocks</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-interaction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs Interaction</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amendments</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infernal-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Infernal Expansion</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>希望您的模組被列入此處？請在此<a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/soul-fire-d/issues/new?assignees=Crystal-Spider&labels=question,medium priority&projects=&template=information_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交問題</a>並提供您模組的連結！</p>\n<h2>🔗 <strong>依賴項目</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/promehteus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必要</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>📜 <strong>授權與使用權利</strong></h2>\n<p>歡迎將本模組用於任何模組包或影片，只需務必注明出處並可能連結至<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/soul-fire-d#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。<br>\n本專案已發布於<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/soul-fire-d/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">水晶巢社群授權條款 v1</a>下。</p>\n<h2>💻 <strong>給開發者</strong></h2>\n<p>自<strong>v6.0.0</strong>起，API 已遷移至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a>。\n請透過詳細文件了解如何整合自訂火焰類型並利用提供的 API：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>📖 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API 維基</a></li>\n<li>📘 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/wiki/Data-Driven-Fires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包整合維基</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>❤️ <strong>支持我們</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest Website\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"Our other projects\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
